    "updated_at": "2026-06-24T09:25:52Z",
    "body": "What kind of flakiness did you see @josepharhar ? I have a local implementation of what @annevk suggested (prior to the last change) and there was no flakiness in Gecko. I also couldn't find spec evidence that suggested there may be any (and I liked the idea of getting rid of post-connection steps...)",
